  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tMTD IT\n\t\tMTD IT FAQs\n\n### Unlink an individual in MY ADMIN\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 23 Jul, 2026 at 12:30 PM\n\n\t\tHow to Unlink an Individual in My Admin and Re-link the client in Capium 365\n\nPurpose: Follow these steps to remove an incorrectly linked individual from a Sole Trader record and then re -link the client to the correct individual in Capium365. \n\n### 1. Open My Admin\n\nNavigate to My Admin and open the relevant Sole Trader record.Navigation: My Admin → Clients → Select the relevant Sole Trader\n\nEdit the Record: Click the Pencil Icon next to Edit Client, to open the record for editing.\nRemove Existing Link: untick the \"Link to SA100\" checkbox and click Save.\n\n### 3. Re-link the Sole Trader to the Correct Individual\n\nNavigate to the Capium365 Client Portal, open the relevant Sole Trader record, select the correct Individual from the drop-down list, and click Save.\n\nNavigation > Capium 365 > Client Portal \n\nPlease refer to the GIF below.\n\nNote: For more detailed instructions on linking Sole Traders to Individuals, please refer to the MTD IT - Linking Individuals and Sole Traders article.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
