: 14px; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 14px; font-family: Cambria, serif;\"><h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-end=\"553\" data-section-id=\"ksjhhy\" data-start=\"533\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">1.</span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Open My Admin</strong></span></span></span></h3><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Navigate to <strong data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"566\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">My Admin</strong> and open the relevant <strong data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"601\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sole Trader</strong> record.</span></span></span></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 10pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 115%; font-size: 15px; font-family: Cambria, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"626\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Navigation:</strong> <strong data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"655\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">My Admin</strong> → <strong data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"670\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Clients</strong> → Select the relevant&nbsp;</span></span><strong data-end=\"719\" data-start=\"704\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sole Trader</span></strong></span><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9251820997/original/Mibxb-KowNsg8W6sCbPNAYGcUHt2xR9cmA.gif?1784800927\" style=\"width: 599px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9251820997\"><br></span></p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 14px;\"><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Edit the Record:&nbsp;</strong>Click the Pencil Icon next to Edit Client, to open the record for editing.</span></li><li style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Remove Existing Link:&nbsp;</strong>untick the \"Link to SA100\" checkbox and click Save.</span></li></ol><p style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9251821359/original/bEX7Jrn-mEuVIP6eMRY6S3BAz_O5UmPdOw.gif?1784801474\" style=\"width: 600px; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9251821359\"></span></p><h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-end=\"134\" data-section-id=\"cm6oej\" data-start=\"78\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">3. <strong>Re-link the Sole Trader to the Correct Individual</strong></span></h3><p data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"136\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span s